    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so once i get the bottom panel off or whatever, is there like a specific way to dry it out? i dont want to just shove a towel in there and hope for the best. also how do i know if the sensor is actually broken or if it's just a temporary leak?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
